  diaryTitle: father's diary
  diaryText: Today I decided to take out another loan, even though I know my wife
    will probably be worried about the debt we're about to face. But I don't see
    any other choice. Our expenses are too much for us to handle. I've been trying
    to work as much as I can, but it's still not enough
